# Normalize line endings in the repository and on checkout.
#
# scripts/validate.sh compares the .skill bundle (always LF) against the
# working tree byte for byte, and hooks/gate-preflight.sh is executed
# directly by its shebang. Both break on a CRLF checkout, which is what
# core.autocrlf=true produces on Windows -- the platform most likely to be
# editing this skill. GATE_REFERENCE.md Gate 6 prescribes exactly this fix
# for other projects; the repo now follows its own rule.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch the packaged skill: it is a zip.
*.skill binary